header.gc-header-standard.gc-header-login
  .container
    .gc-login-form-wrapper.col-sm-6.cal-xs-12
      h1.text-center
        | Almost Ready
      form.gc-signup-form(role="form")
        i.gc-almost-ready-icon
        .gc-matching-trainer-message
          p 
            | We're in the process of matching you 
            br
            | with your GymCloud Trainer.
          p
            | We'll send you an email notification.
            br 
            | Thanks for your patience.
        .row.form-group.text-center
            button.btn.btn-default.gc-back-btn(type="submit")
              | Back to HomePage
      p.gc-login-signup-wrapper.text-center
        | Have a Gymcloud account? 
        a(href='#login')
          | Sign In
